      "chunk_text": "Customer Akanksha Bhatt contacted agent Karan Joshi because her auto policy (AP-123456) expired on the day of the call. She inquired about reinstatement options versus getting a new policy to ensure coverage for the next day. The agent explained the 30-day reinstatement window, fees, and that same-day reinstatement takes effect within an hour of payment. After discussing deductibles and potential loss of no-claims discounts for a new policy, the customer opted to reinstate her existing policy. The agent provided a payment link for the total amount of $152.75.",
